const WH=[
 ['w_recv',['1 · Receive and check','1 · Kupokea na kukagua'],['Every delivery is counted against the purchase order, batch numbers and expiry dates are scanned, and registration labels are checked before anything is put away. Goods arriving with less than two-thirds of their shelf life left are refused. Damaged cartons are photographed and returned the same day.','Kila mzigo unahesabiwa dhidi ya oda ya manunuzi, namba za batch na tarehe za kuisha muda hupigwa skana, na lebo za usajili hukaguliwa kabla kitu chochote hakijapangwa. Bidhaa zinazofika zikiwa na chini ya theluthi mbili ya muda wake wa matumizi hukataliwa. Katoni zilizoharibika hupigwa picha na kurudishwa siku hiyo hiyo.'],['Goal: every pallet checked and on the system within 4 hours','Lengo: kila paleti imekaguliwa na iko kwenye mfumo ndani ya saa 4']],
 ['w_over',['2 · Put away by speed','2 · Kupanga kwa kasi ya mauzo'],['Racking is colour-coded by Care Zone and slotted by how fast each family sells. The fastest 20% of families, which carry about 60% of the volume, live in the low, front locations nearest the packing tables; slow, specialist lines go high and to the back. Every location has a barcode, so any product can be found by any staff member.','Rafu za ghala zina rangi kwa Kanda ya Huduma na zimepangwa kwa kasi ya mauzo ya kila familia. Asilimia 20 ya familia zinazouzwa kwa kasi zaidi, zinazobeba takriban asilimia 60 ya mzigo, zinakaa sehemu za chini na za mbele karibu na meza za kufungashia; bidhaa za polepole na za kitaalamu huenda juu na nyuma. Kila sehemu ina msimbopau, kwa hiyo bidhaa yoyote inaweza kupatikana na mfanyakazi yeyote.'],['Fast movers within 10 steps of packing','Bidhaa za kasi ndani ya hatua 10 kutoka ufungashaji']],
 ['w_pick',['3 · Pick faces','3 · Sehemu za kuchukulia'],['Small items are picked from labelled bins on flow shelving, one bin per product, refilled from the back. A picker follows the route printed on the order, so the trolley moves in one direction and never doubles back.','Bidhaa ndogo huchukuliwa kutoka kwenye mapipa yenye lebo kwenye rafu zinazoteleza, pipa moja kwa kila bidhaa, yanajazwa kutoka nyuma. Mchukuaji hufuata njia iliyochapishwa kwenye oda, ili toroli liende upande mmoja bila kurudi nyuma.'],['Target: 99.8% of lines picked right first time','Lengo: asilimia 99.8 ya bidhaa zichukuliwe sahihi mara ya kwanza']],
 ['w_bulky',['4 · Bulky and rental bay','4 · Sehemu ya mizigo mikubwa na ya kukodisha'],['Wheelchairs, frames, beds and mattresses have their own ground-level bay with marked floor slots. Rental equipment is kept separate from new stock: each unit carries an asset tag with its cleaning record, condition photos and next booking.','Viti vya magurudumu, fremu, vitanda na magodoro vina sehemu yao ya chini yenye nafasi zilizowekwa alama sakafuni. Vifaa vya kukodisha hutenganishwa na bidhaa mpya: kila kimoja kina alama ya mali yenye rekodi ya usafi, picha za hali yake na oda inayofuata.'],['Clean, tested and ready within 24 hours of return','Safi, kimejaribiwa na tayari ndani ya saa 24 baada ya kurudishwa']],
 ['w_season',['5 · Seasonal pre-build','5 · Maandalizi ya msimu'],['Six weeks before each season the next season’s stock is built up in a marked block on the floor: nets, ORS and water treatment before masika, school bundles before January and July, gift boxes before December. On the first day of the season the block goes to the season points in the store in one move.','Wiki sita kabla ya kila msimu, bidhaa za msimu unaofuata hukusanywa kwenye eneo lenye alama sakafuni: vyandarua, ORS na dawa za kutibu maji kabla ya masika, vifurushi vya shule kabla ya Januari na Julai, masanduku ya zawadi kabla ya Desemba. Siku ya kwanza ya msimu, eneo hilo huhamishiwa kwenye sehemu za msimu dukani kwa mara moja.'],['Season stock ready 6 weeks ahead','Bidhaa za msimu tayari wiki 6 kabla']],
 ['w_pack',['6 · Pack','6 · Kufungasha'],['Afya Box and online orders are packed at numbered tables with a scale and a label printer. Each box is weighed against its expected weight, so a missing item is caught before the box is sealed. Gift orders get the printed message card.','Afya Box na oda za mtandaoni hufungashwa kwenye meza zenye namba, mizani na printa ya lebo. Kila sanduku hupimwa uzito dhidi ya uzito unaotarajiwa, ili bidhaa inayokosekana igundulike kabla sanduku halijafungwa. Oda za zawadi hupata kadi ya ujumbe iliyochapishwa.'],['A box packed in under 6 minutes','Sanduku hufungashwa chini ya dakika 6']],
 ['w_restock',['7 · Restock the store','7 · Kujaza duka'],['The store shelves are a mirror of the warehouse map. Every night the system lists what sold; a crate per zone is picked and the shelves are faced before opening, oldest expiry to the front. Nothing is ever stored behind the shelves.','Rafu za duka ni kioo cha ramani ya ghala. Kila usiku mfumo huorodhesha kilichouzwa; kreti moja kwa kila kanda huchukuliwa na rafu hupangwa kabla ya kufungua, tarehe ya karibu zaidi mbele. Hakuna kinachohifadhiwa nyuma ya rafu.'],['Shelves full at opening, every day','Rafu zimejaa wakati wa kufungua, kila siku']],
 ['w_dispatch',['8 · Dispatch','8 · Kusafirisha'],['Sealed boxes leave in two daily waves by rider, grouped by route and handed to the store’s riders. The customer receives the rider’s name and a delivery photo; gift senders receive the photo too.','Masanduku yaliyofungwa huondoka kwa awamu mbili kila siku kupitia wasafirishaji wa duka, yakipangwa kwa njia. Mteja hupokea jina la msafirishaji na picha ya kufikisha; watumaji wa zawadi pia hupokea picha hiyo.'],['Same day in Dar for orders before 15:00','Siku hiyo hiyo Dar kwa oda kabla ya saa 9 alasiri']]];

