 season:['Seasons','Misimu'],handle:['Handling','Utunzaji'],size:['Size','Ukubwa'],role:['Role','Nafasi'],close:['Close','Funga'],
 m_buy:['The investor buying desk','Dawati la manunuzi la mwekezaji'],
 buy_ld:['Choose what to stock and for which month. The desk counts the opening stock at cost, the sales and gross profit for that month, the shelf space in the store and the locations in the warehouse. Start from a preset, then tick or untick families in the order sheet.','Chagua cha kuweka stoo na kwa mwezi upi. Dawati linahesabu bidhaa za kuanzia kwa gharama, mauzo na faida ghafi ya mwezi huo, nafasi ya rafu dukani na sehemu za ghala. Anza na mpangilio uliowekwa, kisha weka au ondoa alama kwenye familia katika karatasi ya oda.'],
